<main id="guide"><article><header><h1>Change the workspace plan</h1><p>Update a plan and invite its billing contact.</p><p class="metadata">App: Example workspace · Captured: 2026-11-24T10:00:00Z · Verified: passed (2026-11-25T09:00:00Z) · Schema: stepdoc/guide@1 · Version: 3</p></header>
<aside aria-label="Requirements"><h2>Preconditions</h2><ul><li>Signed in with the Owner role</li></ul>
<h2>Variables</h2><dl><dt>billing_email (secret)</dt><dd>Billing contact</dd><dt>seats (variable)</dt><dd>number</dd><dt>plan (variable)</dt><dd>enum</dd></dl></aside>
<ol><li id="step-1" data-sd-step="1">
<h2>Click Change plan</h2><p>Open the plan dialog.</p>
<p>Page: <a href="https://example.com/settings" rel="noreferrer">https://example.com/settings</a></p>
<p>Target: button “Change plan”; frames: iframe#settings; open shadow hosts: plan-card</p>
<p>Action: click</p>

<p>Expected: URL matches /settings</p>
<p>Expected: dialog Choose plan is visible</p>
<p>Expected: status Loading is hidden</p>
<p>Expected: heading contains Choose a plan</p>
<figure><img src="img/step-1.webp" alt="The Change plan button" width="1440" height="900"><figcaption>The Change plan button</figcaption></figure>
<p>Note: Use the current plan card.</p>
</li>
<li id="step-2" data-sd-step="2">
<h2>Fill in the Billing contact field</h2><p>Fill in the Billing contact field</p>

<p>Target: textbox “Billing contact”</p>
<p>Action: fill</p>
<p>Value: billing_email (secret; STEPDOC_BILLING_EMAIL)</p>



</li>
<li id="step-3" data-sd-step="3">
<h2>Fill in the Seats field</h2><p>Fill in the Seats field</p>


<p>Action: fill</p>
<p>Value: seats (variable; STEPDOC_SEATS)</p>



</li>
<li id="step-4" data-sd-step="4">
<h2>Select Team</h2><p>Select Team</p>


<p>Action: select</p>
<p>Value: Option: Team</p>



</li>
<li id="step-5" data-sd-step="5">
<h2>Press Enter</h2><p>Press Enter</p>


<p>Action: press</p>
<p>Value: Key: Enter</p>



</li>
<li id="step-6" data-sd-step="6">
<h2>Finish setup</h2><p>Finish setup</p>







</li>
<li id="step-7" data-sd-step="7">
<h2>Go to the dashboard</h2><p>Go to the dashboard</p>
<p>Page: <a href="https://example.com/dashboard" rel="noreferrer">https://example.com/dashboard</a></p>

<p>Action: navigate</p>




</li>
<li id="step-8" data-sd-step="8">
<h2>Confirm the new plan</h2><p>Confirm the new plan</p>


<p>Action: assert</p>

<p>Expected: Page contains Team</p>


</li></ol></article></main><footer>Created with StepDoc · stepdoc/guide@1</footer></body></html>
