"# Change the workspace plan

Update a plan and invite its billing contact\\.

App: Example workspace · Captured: 2026\\-11\\-24T10:00:00Z · Verified: passed \\(2026\\-11\\-25T09:00:00Z\\) · Schema: stepdoc/guide@1 · Version: 3

## Preconditions

- Signed in with the Owner role

## Variables

| Name | Kind | Type | Environment | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| billing\\_email | secret | string | STEPDOC_BILLING_EMAIL | Billing contact |
| seats | variable | number | STEPDOC_SEATS |  |
| plan | variable | enum | STEPDOC_PLAN | Options: Basic, Team |

Supply values at replay time. Stored examples are never used as replay defaults.

## Steps

### 1. Click Change plan

Open the plan dialog\\.

Page: <https://example.com/settings>

Target: button “Change plan”; frames: iframe\\#settings; open shadow hosts: plan\\-card

Action: click

Expected: URL matches /settings

Expected: dialog Choose plan is visible

Expected: status Loading is hidden

Expected: heading contains Choose a plan

![The Change plan button](<img/step-1.webp>)

Note: Use the current plan card\\.

### 2. Fill in the Billing contact field

Target: textbox “Billing contact”

Action: fill

Value: billing\\_email \\(secret; STEPDOC\\_BILLING\\_EMAIL\\)

### 3. Fill in the Seats field

Action: fill

Value: seats \\(variable; STEPDOC\\_SEATS\\)

### 4. Select Team

Action: select

Value: Option: Team

### 5. Press Enter

Action: press

Value: Key: Enter

### 6. Finish setup

### 7. Go to the dashboard

Page: <https://example.com/dashboard>

Action: navigate

### 8. Confirm the new plan

Action: assert

Expected: Page contains Team
"
`;

